<title>LITHUANIA: C.BANK TO DECIDE ON CREDITANSTALT REP OFFICE.</title>
<headline>C.BANK TO DECIDE ON CREDITANSTALT REP OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Thursday it expected to approve an application by Austria's Creditanstalt to set up a representative office in Lithuania.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't see any reason why we should not permit the bank to open its representative office,&quot; the central bank governor, Reinoldijus Sharkinas, told reporters before the meeting of the board of the Bank of Lithuania.</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vinius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
